["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">公用</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">公务；政务；公事；公用；政府专用</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">紅葉</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">红叶；秋叶；秋色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">小売</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">零售；零售业</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">公立</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうりつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">公立</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75434\">その<ruby>当時<rp>(</rp><rt>とうじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、どこの<ruby>公立<rp>(</rp><rt>こうりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもネイティブの<ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>などいませんでした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">当时没有任何以英语为母语的人在公立学校任教。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/811792\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">効率</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうりつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">效率</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>作業<rp>(</rp><rt>さぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>効率<rp>(</rp><rt>こうりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げる<ruby>方法<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>考<rp>(</rp><rt>かんが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">思考提高作业效率的方法。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">交流</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうりゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">交流；往来；互动；融合；汇聚；交流电；交变电流；AC</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">考慮</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうりょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">考虑；斟酌</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183569\"><ruby>危険<rp>(</rp><rt>きけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>考慮<rp>(</rp><rt>こうりょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>あと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>残<rp>(</rp><rt>のこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">考虑到危险,他留在后面。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">効力</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうりょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">效力；效能；有效性；效果</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206750\">その<ruby>法律<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はもう<ruby>効力<rp>(</rp><rt>こうりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はなくなっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">法律已经不有效了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">声</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">声音；嗓音；鸟鸣；虫鸣；叫声；意见；呼声；观点；愿望；态度；意志；声音；预感；感觉；浊音</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"1142225\">あなたの<ruby>声<rp>(</rp><rt>こえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けてうれしいわ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">很高兴听到你的声音。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1531644\" title=\"Tatoeba · cc_neko\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · cc_neko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">超える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">越过；跨越；穿过；经过；超越；超出；超过；超越；胜过；多于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">越える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">越过；跨越；穿过；经过；超越；超出；超过；超越；胜过；多于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205050\">それは<ruby>人知<rp>(</rp><rt>じんち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>限界<rp>(</rp><rt>げんかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>越<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它超越了知识界限。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">氷</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こおり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">冰；刨冰；冰沙</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141097\"><ruby>船<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>氷<rp>(</rp><rt>こおり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>閉<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じ<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>められてしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">船被困在冰上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">凍る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こおる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">冻结；冻住；结冰</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126564\"><ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らないと、<ruby>耳<rp>(</rp><rt>みみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>凍<rp>(</rp><rt>こお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りそうだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果你进去,你的耳朵会冷冻。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">焦がす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こがす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">烧焦；烤焦；烧黑；炭化</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206741\">その<ruby>亡命者<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼうめいしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>故国<rp>(</rp><rt>ここく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>への<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>胸<rp>(</rp><rt>むね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>焦<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难民的心情向他们的祖国推动。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">小柄</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こがら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">身材矮小；娇小玲珑；小花纹；细图案</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"139910\"><ruby>息子<rp>(</rp><rt>むすこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>とし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>小柄<rp>(</rp><rt>こがら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">儿子年龄较小。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼吸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">呼吸；呼吸作用；窍门；诀窍；秘诀；和谐；协调；同步；配合；短暂间隔；短暂停顿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189164\"><ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>発音<rp>(</rp><rt>はつおん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>呼吸<rp>(</rp><rt>こきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がなかなか<ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">英语发音的呼吸不太好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">故郷</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こきょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">故乡；出生地；老家</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"12179643\"><ruby>久<rp>(</rp><rt>ひさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しぶりに<ruby>故郷<rp>(</rp><rt>こきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ると、<ruby>懐<rp>(</rp><rt>なつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かしい<ruby>気持<rp>(</rp><rt>きも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちが<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">回到家后,很久很久很久很久很久很久很久很久。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">小切手</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こぎって</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">支票</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221176\">この<ruby>小切手<rp>(</rp><rt>こぎって</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>現金<rp>(</rp><rt>げんきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にしてくれますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你能把这支票拿到现金吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国王</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくおう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国王；女王；君主；统治者；王权；王位</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173026\"><ruby>国民<rp>(</rp><rt>こくみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>歓呼<rp>(</rp><rt>かんこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>国王<rp>(</rp><rt>こくおう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>迎<rp>(</rp><rt>むか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">民众欢迎他成为国王。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国語</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国语；日语（尤指日本学校的语文科目）；本国语；母语；和语词汇（相对于外来词和汉语借词）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"107254\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>国語<rp>(</rp><rt>こくご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きだし<ruby>得意<rp>(</rp><rt>とくい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他喜欢语言,他很聪明。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国際</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくさい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国际的；国际性的；外交往来；邦交往来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189129\"><ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>国際<rp>(</rp><rt>こくさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>言語<rp>(</rp><rt>げんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">英语是国际语言。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/811873\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国産</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国产；国内生产；日本产</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76689\">しかし、<ruby>国産<rp>(</rp><rt>こくさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ワインといっても、<ruby>国内<rp>(</rp><rt>こくない</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>瓶詰<rp>(</rp><rt>びんづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めされたものは<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>すべ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て<ruby>国産<rp>(</rp><rt>こくさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ワインとなります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">但是,即使是国内葡萄酒,在国内包装的所有瓶子都是国内葡萄酒。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国籍</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくせき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国籍；国民身份；（船舶、飞机等的）国籍；登记国；船旗国</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173042\"><ruby>国籍<rp>(</rp><rt>こくせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>関係<rp>(</rp><rt>かんけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なくすべての<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>資格<rp>(</rp><rt>しかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">无论国籍如何,每个人都有资格。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国家规定的；国定的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国土</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国土；领土；疆域；领域</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230172\">アメリカは<ruby>国土<rp>(</rp><rt>こくど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>広<rp>(</rp><rt>ひろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く、<ruby>人々<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとびと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はよく<ruby>移動<rp>(</rp><rt>いどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">美国有广阔的土地,人们经常移动。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">告白</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくはく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坦白；供认；认罪；表白（爱意）；示爱；表明信仰；信仰告白；忏悔；告解</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"105557\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きになったと<ruby>告白<rp>(</rp><rt>こくはく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他承认自己喜欢我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">黒板</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくばん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">黑板</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"159712\"><ruby>黒板<rp>(</rp><rt>こくばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きますね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">写在黑板上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">克服</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくふく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a