>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">漕ぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">划桨；摇桨；划船；踩踏；蹬踏（自行车等）；荡（秋千）；操作（手动泵）；穿过；推进（灌木丛、深雪等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96565\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>池<rp>(</rp><rt>いけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でボートを<ruby>漕<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们在池子里游船。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">焦げ茶</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こげちゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深褐色；橄榄褐色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">焦げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">烧焦；烧糊；炭化；烤焦</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227386\">お<ruby>菓子<rp>(</rp><rt>かし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>焦<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げないように<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけていなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">要小心糖果不会燃烧。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ここ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span clas